# Platform Control Center — read API (P1 EPIC A)

## Scope

Platform ops HTTP surface under **`/platform/v1/*`**. Production provisioning uses **`POST /platform/v1/tenants`** (not `/internal/tenants/provision`).

EPIC A adds **read** endpoints for workspace catalog and tenant directory. All routes require platform ops auth headers:

| Header | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `Authorization: Bearer …` | Must match `PLATFORM_OPS_BEARER_TOKEN` (dev default `platform-ops`) |
| `X-Platform-Ops-Phone` | Ops phone; role from `platform_ops_users` when present, else env whitelist |

Authenticated ops context from `assertPlatformOpsAuth`: `{ actorId: phone, roles: [dbRole \| "owner"] }`.

### Platform ops auth (P0)

| Surface | Mechanism |
|---------|-----------|
| API `/platform/v1/*` | Bearer + phone headers; role from DB |
| API `/platform/v1/auth/request-otp` | Phone in `platform_ops_users` or `PLATFORM_OPS_PHONES` |
| API `/platform/v1/auth/verify-otp` | OTP + phone access → **`platformSessionToken`** (RS256 JWT) |
| Web cookie `platform_session` | JWT (`kind=platform_ops`, `sub=phone`, `platform_role`) — not forgeable JSON |

Signing: `signPlatformOpsSessionToken` (`apps/api/src/platform/sign-platform-ops-session-token.ts`) — same `AUTH_JWT_*` keys as operator sessions.

Env:

| Variable | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `PLATFORM_OPS_BEARER_TOKEN` | Expected Bearer secret for BFF → API |
| `PLATFORM_OPS_PHONES` | CSV fallback when phone absent from DB |

## Route inventory

| Method | Path | Handler | Auth |
|--------|------|---------|------|
| `GET` | `/platform/v1/workspaces` | `handlePlatformWorkspaces` | read |
| `GET` | `/platform/v1/tenants` | `handlePlatformTenantsList` | read |
| `GET` | `/platform/v1/tenants/{tenantId}` | `handlePlatformTenantsGet` | read |
| `POST` | `/platform/v1/tenants` | `handlePlatformTenantsCreate` | write |

`handlePlatformTenantsGet` accepts optional test deps `{ repository, subscriptionRepository, auth }` so unit specs can mock `PlatformTenantRepository`, `PlatformSubscriptionRepository` (P2-C billing on detail DTO), and `PlatformOpsUserRepository` (avoids `PLATFORM_OPS_PHONES` races under parallel `node --test`).

### P1 gate

| Command | Scope |
|---------|--------|
| `pnpm run p1:gate` | Fast subset: core platform unit specs + structural smokes (`<~2min`, no Postgres) |
| `pnpm run p1:gate:full` | All `platform*.spec.ts` (API + web) + structural smokes |
| `pnpm run p1:live-smoke` | Opt-in: live `POST /platform/v1/tenants` → assert **201** + `tenant`/`sites`/`invite` (requires `DATABASE_URL` + `DATABASE_URL_ADMIN` + running API) |
| `pnpm run p1:e2e-gate` | Playwright platform E2E (Postgres + migrate) |

```bash
pnpm run p1:gate
pnpm run p1:gate:full
pnpm run p1:e2e-gate
# optional when Postgres + API available:
pnpm run p1:live-smoke
```

Handler behavioral coverage: `platform-provision.spec.ts` calls `handlePlatformTenantsCreate` for **401** / **403** / **400** (idempotency); **201** runs only when `DATABASE_URL` and `DATABASE_URL_ADMIN` are set.

Dispatch: `apps/api/src/http/platform-route-registrar.ts` → `tryDispatchPlatformRoutes` from `app.ts`.

OpenAPI SoT: `apps/api/src/openapi/dispatch-routes.ts` (`DISPATCH_ROUTES`).

## Tenant directory

### Repository

`PlatformTenantRepository` (`apps/api/src/platform/platform-tenant.repository.ts`) uses **`getPrismaAdmin()`** only — no tenant RLS context. Queries `tenants` with a fixed select:

`id`, `subdomain`, `workspaceType`, `status`, `createdAt`.

| Method | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| `listPaginated(limit, offset)` | `findMany` ordered by `createdAt desc` + `count()` |
| `getById(id)` | `findUnique` by UUID; `null` when missing |

Defaults: `limit=50` (max 100), `offset=0`.

### DTO

`toPlatformTenantDto` (`platform-tenant.dto.ts`) maps a repository row to JSON-safe shape:

```json
{
  "id": "uuid",
  "subdomain": "my-club",
  "workspaceType": "denali",
  "status": "active",
  "createdAt": "2026-06-21T12:00:00.000Z"
}
```

No Prisma internals or `theme` blob in list/get responses.

### List response

`GET /platform/v1/tenants?limit=50&offset=0`:

```json
{
  "items": [ /* PlatformTenantDto[] */ ],
  "total": 42,
  "limit": 50,
  "offset": 0
}
```

### Get response

- `200` — `PlatformTenantDetailDto`:

```json
{
  "tenant": { "id", "subdomain", "workspaceType", "status", "createdAt" },
  "sites": { "marketing", "portal", "admin" },
  "ownerInvite": { "inviteId", "phone", "status" }
}
```

`ownerInvite` is `null` when no pending owner invite exists.

- `404` — `{ "error": "not_found", "code": "NOT_FOUND" }`

## Workspaces catalog

`GET /platform/v1/workspaces` returns `{ "workspaces": [{ "id", "types", "displayName" }] }` from `listPlatformWorkspaces()` (registry-backed, `denali` minimum).

