## P3-A — Workspace definitions (metadata)

Detail: [`../phase-16/platform-workspace-definitions.mdoc`](../phase-16/platform-workspace-definitions.mdoc).

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/platform/v1/workspace-definitions` | list + latest published version |
